[ceiling] Flat transition from the fitted motor bore to the wider open terminal well. The cap prints crown-down; support is open to the bed and withdraws axially through the same Ø45 well before pump installation.
alternatives: Extending the Ø45 opening through the complete motor bore removes its locating shoulder. A sloping transition changes the retained motor seat. The flat shoulder retains that fitted interface and receives supports through the open terminal well; its printed finish and support removal keep their own physical scope.
